Price and admit OpenAI gpt-6.1-sol; allow its xhigh and max reasoning efforts.

Owner direction 2026-11-02: ARTISAN authors with gpt-6.1-sol at maximum
reasoning instead of gpt-6-astra. Rates, context window and reasoning efforts
were read on 2026-11-02 from
https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6.1-sol: $2 input, $0.10
cached input, $2.50 cache writes, $10 output per 1M tokens (2x input and cache,
1.5x output above 272K input tokens); a 1,050,000-token context window; and
reasoning.effort low, medium (default), high, xhigh and max.

Applied after 0001-confine-generated-code.patch, against
physicalvision/Artisan@ad322b5b31e50bdb84155520f09622c00c6056c3.

